{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br>Crypto Trading Simulator puts you in the shoes of a digital trader navigating a living, reactive market. Every decision \u2014 from opening a position to managing your risk \u2014 affects your balance and how fast you can rise in the trading world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a limited balance, make smart trades, and reinvest your earnings to improve your setup. Build your trading empire from a modest desk to a full high-end command center glowing with RGB lights and luxury gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MARKET ENVIRONMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices move based on simulated events, global news, and social chatter. Watch how sentiment shifts as traders react to airdrops, exchange hacks, fee changes, or influencer posts. Some trends fade fast, others reshape the whole market \u2014 adapt quickly or lose your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/7cc0c7c76efc3d321821d5d418f813a3.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/7cc0c7c76efc3d321821d5d418f813a3.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/7cc0c7c76efc3d321821d5d418f813a3.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADVANCED TRADING TOOLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful analysis tools like trend lines, RSI, Volume, and Bollinger Bands. Draw directly on charts, mark your entries and exits, and visualize your trades with detailed reports. Every chart tells a story \u2014 read it well.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/679eec7c5387db88e44f3934d1f3a442.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/679eec7c5387db88e44f3934d1f3a442.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/679eec7c5387db88e44f3934d1f3a442.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARKETPLACE &amp; UPGRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to purchase new software and room upgrades. Trading bots, protection tools, signal systems, and visual customization items let you expand both your technical power and your trader\u2019s environment. Design your perfect workspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/84fdc5fe2b2fbf6322396c648a3e129d.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/84fdc5fe2b2fbf6322396c648a3e129d.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/84fdc5fe2b2fbf6322396c648a3e129d.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARKET EVENTS IN ACTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the market come alive as unexpected events unfold \u2014 sudden airdrops spark buying frenzies, fee hikes slow trading, and exchange hacks trigger panic selloffs. Each event ripples through prices, sentiment, and trade flow. Stay alert, react fast, and use volatility to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/400ba1fcaeaf36eb930e8a6779d178b9.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/400ba1fcaeaf36eb930e8a6779d178b9.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/400ba1fcaeaf36eb930e8a6779d178b9.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERFORMANCE INSIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your journey with detailed trade history and performance reports. Every position, every win or loss is logged and visualized. Identify patterns, refine your strategy, and discover what truly drives your profits. In the end, data is your greatest teacher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/152e845ddc2bbc70ab34511b0d06ef65.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/152e845ddc2bbc70ab34511b0d06ef65.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/152e845ddc2bbc70ab34511b0d06ef65.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOCIAL FEED SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow an in-game social media feed filled with traders, trolls, analysts, and insiders. Their posts can hint at opportunities or chaos. Learn which signals to trust, which rumors to ignore, and when to act before the market does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FUTURE EXPANSIONS</strong><br>Upcoming features will include an <strong>Education &amp; Tasks</strong> section with guided missions and a variety of <strong>Software Systems</strong> to expand gameplay \u2014 from buy/sell automation to advanced protection tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROOM CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your trading profits into style and comfort. Buy new furniture, gadgets, and decorations to transform your workspace \u2014 from a minimalist setup to a glowing, high-end trading hub. Rearrange, upgrade, and personalize every detail to reflect your success and taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/53d9c8018bb765a601b1eeb9dbb661c4.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/53d9c8018bb765a601b1eeb9dbb661c4.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR TRADER, YOUR STYLE</strong><br>Some players analyze. Some gamble. Some automate. However you trade, your progress is reflected in your balance, your room, and your reputation. Will you stay cautious, or risk it all for the biggest wins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/98a951602df80a7689d1cc6773917965.poster.avif?t=1763038495\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/98a951602df80a7689d1cc6773917965.webm?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/extras/98a951602df80a7689d1cc6773917965.mp4?t=1763038495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4163000?t=1763038495","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/1ad9d96c4d83e3b46c105d5c203be40e9a5582d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763038495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/cc9061df2dd3cd063d59b11d8a5a05fc288ac99b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763038495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163000/cc9061df2dd3cd063d59b11d8a5a05fc288ac99b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763038495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong><br>Crypto Trading Simulator puts you in the shoes of a digital trader navigating a living, reactive market. Every decision \u2014 from opening a position to managing your risk \u2014 affects your balance and how fast you can rise in the trading world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a limited balance, make smart trades, and reinvest your earnings to improve your setup. Build your trading empire from a modest desk to a full high-end command center glowing with RGB lights and luxury gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MARKET ENVIRONMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices move based on simulated events, global news, and social chatter. Watch how sentiment shifts as traders react to airdrops, exchange hacks, fee changes, or infl